From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Salty <99386653+PjSalty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:30:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] migrations: model snapshot for the Jellyfin 12.1 schema

Intent: the EF model snapshot for the 12.1 model, as dotnet ef 10.0.11
generates it through the plugin's design-time factory. It pairs with the 17
PostgreSQL migrations in overlay/Migrations, whose ids equal upstream's
SQLite ids added between 10.11.11 and 12.1; the last one's target model is
this snapshot, and adding a migration on top scaffolds nothing.
Drop when: upstream ships its own 12.x migrations and snapshot.
Ceiling: regenerate it with dotnet ef, never by hand, whenever the server
model moves.
---
